creature Book
  traits
    title is text
    available is true or false
  end traits

  when born with (title)
    give self the trait title to title
    give self the trait available to true
  end born
end creature

creature Member
  traits
    name is text
  end traits

  when born with (name)
    give self the trait name to name
  end born

  action borrow
    when self knows anyone as target_book
      give book_ref to self target_book
      when book_ref available == true
        give book_ref the trait available to false
        say self name + " successfully borrowed " + book_ref title
      otherwise
        say self name + " tried to borrow " + book_ref title + " but it is not available."
      end when
    end when
  end action

  action return_book
    when self knows anyone as target_book
      give book_ref to self target_book
      give book_ref the trait available to true
      say self name + " returned " + book_ref title
      self forgets target_book
    end when
  end action
end creature

bring MobyDick to life as Book with ("Moby Dick")
bring Alice to life as Member with ("Alice")
bring Bob to life as Member with ("Bob")

Alice knows MobyDick as target_book
Alice does borrow

Bob knows MobyDick as target_book
Bob does borrow

Alice does return_book
Bob does borrow
